<model>
  <name>bolt_m5x35</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>
  <author><name>obijuan</name></author>
  <description>Test bolt: ISO 4762 M6x40 socket head cap screw uniformly scaled by 0.875 (= M3x20 test bolt x1.75, M5.25x35 equivalent, non-standard size), zinc finish. Mesh: FreeCAD-library (ISO4762_Hex_Socket_Head_Cap_Screw_M6x40.stl), CC-BY 3.0, author obijuan, https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD-library commit f5ca01cdcaa2f69b9295a6382719c2d90628780c. M6x40 메시를 0.875배(M3x20 대비 1.75배)로 축소해 사용(mm 단위 메시, scale 0.000875).</description>
</model>
